+    - ponytail: the panel is 5 rows taller (15 with a LoD debug mode on); Perf and Graphics are the cut if it is too tall on a 720p screen. UNVERIFIED on a device: the new button's label and the row widths with `[...]`, and that `Drs` starting over at 67% after a switch-on is smooth (`Present::resize` once).
